.Dd October 3, 2026
.Dt TOUCH 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm touch
.Nd update timestamps or create files
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl amc
.Ar file ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
creates files if they don't exist or updates their timestamps.
.Pp
.Nm
does not yet implement
.Fl d Ar date ,
.Fl r Ar file ,
or
.Fl t Ar timestamp
.Pp
the options are as follows:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl a
change only the access time.
.It Fl m
change only the modification time.
.It Fl c
do not create files that do not exist, and do not report an error for them.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh AUTHORS
.An juanvel400
